        "action_date": "2025-12-03",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>21st Century STEM for Girls and Underrepresented Minorities Act</strong></p><p>This bill directs the Department of Education to make grants to local educational agencies to pay the costs of carrying out science, technology, engineering, and mathematics (STEM)&nbsp;education activities for girls and underrepresented minorities.</p>",
